## Findings

- P1 x11: no overflow, overlap, tofu, or missing credits. Mastheads fit
  in frame in all 11 (FR 42pt with small clearance, IT 46pt flush but
  unclipped — both confirmed by pixel measurement, see verdict §7).
  Monet image + credit present in all 11. Search bars decrease 1-5.
  Pairing badge + footer labels present in all 11.
- P8 x11: no overflow past footer, no overlap, no tofu. Answers blocks
  contained in all 11 (incl. de/fr/nl EXTRA_ONLY 150-key blocks).
  M1 native tails visible in de/fr header bands.
- P7 x11: toolbox B1 line reads `B1 — « Dickens wrote the story in` /
  `1843.»` in all 11 — no lone `»`. Editor's notes (core, zh-tw) read
  clean 2-line notes with the period attached. Golden phrases present.
  No overflow/overlap/tofu.
- P6 es/pt/ru: HOW LONG titles fit inside their boxes, question forms.
  Voting-booth photo + Kenneth C. Zirkel credit present. Chart is text
  rows (no bar rects — consistent with gate finding).
- P6 de: `das Ergebnis verkünden` present in the gloss box; HOW LONG
  title `Wie lange im Amt?` fits.
- P2 fr/ko: gloss boxes single-prefix, substantial final lines, no
  orphans. Ko P2 bridge breaks 일어나다 as 일 | 어날 (2-syllable tail,
  below the S3 bar, pre-existing since Round 1 — observation O-R2-2,
  NOT a defect; see verdict §9).
- P2 zh-tw: RESIDUAL DEFECT R-B6 CONFIRMED VISUALLY. The B · WILL
  bridge renders as line 1 `用 will + 動詞原形來改寫（承諾與將要發生的事`
  and line 2 containing ONLY `）。` at the left margin. Core P2 bridge
  is a single clean line. (Crop: verify2-b6-zh-tw-p2.png.)
- P3 nl/pt: titles `SCROOGE'S NIGHT · Scrooge-nacht` / `· A noite`,
  fit inside boxes. Leech illustration + credit present.
- P3 es/fr: RESIDUAL DEFECT R-M4 CONFIRMED VISUALLY. Titles read
  `LA NOCHE DE SCROOGE` / `LA NUIT DE SCROOGE` with NO English head,
  unlike the other 9 editions. (Crops: verify2-m4-es-p3.png,
  verify2-m4-fr-p3.png.)
- P3/P4 ko: gloss boxes end `은 것.` (P3) / `스타선수.` (P4) — no
  orphan lines; regression fix confirmed as rendered. P3 title keeps
  the English head. Snyder photo + credit on P4.
- No other visual defect was found on any viewed page. In particular:
  no missing glyphs/tofu in ja/ko/ru/CJK pages, no text overflowing
  any box, no overlapped elements, all 5 image credits present
  (textually verified in all 11 editions; visually confirmed on the
  P1/P2/P3/P4/P6 pages viewed).

